@startuml UC9_ViewRooms
!theme plain
title UC9: Xem danh sách phòng

actor User as "Customer/Staff/Admin"
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Backend API" as API
database "Database" as DB

User -> Frontend: Truy cập trang danh sách phòng
Frontend -> API: GET /api/v1/rooms\n(Authorization: Bearer token)\n(query params: page, limit, sort)

API -> API: Verify JWT token (nếu có)
API -> DB: Query rooms\n(populate roomType, filter deleted)

DB --> API: Danh sách phòng + pagination

API --> Frontend: Success + rooms data
Frontend --> User: Hiển thị danh sách phòng
@enduml

